    "detailed_description": "<i><strong>A percentage of all profits made on this game go to WWF to help combat climate change in the world's most vulnerable ecosystems.</strong></i><br><br>Embark upon a unique and tear-jerking journey about an Arctic Wolf and his mission to discover his past in the face of climate change. Explore the vast wilderness that surrounds the East Falls, uncovering clues as to what happened in his past life. <br><br>Set in the imaginary East Falls Mountains, Finding Ice takes the player on a one-of-a-kind experience to discover how manmade climate change has devastated the once sprawling and stunning landscape.<br><br>The player must re-connect with nature in order to progress to the next phase of this story game, <i>they must collect items</i> in order to progress to the next phase of this beautiful story.<br><br>\u2022 Explore many stylized maps as a third-person Arctic Wolf.<br>\u2022 Uncover an emotional story with an outstanding soundtrack.<br>\u2022 Discover the East Falls alongside a variety of 'pets', each with unique characteristics. <br><br><br><strong><br><strong>Uncover a seemingly untouched world through a third-person Arctic Wolf and discover the truth about the catastrophe unfolding before your very eyes:</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069710/extras/3310beb5d9c49a0a58714f8f4c8c0239.poster.avif?t=1673190530\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069710/extras/3310beb5d9c49a0a58714f8f4c8c0239.webm?t=1673190530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2069710/extras/3310beb5d9c49a0a58714f8f4c8c0239.mp4?t=1673190530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>Discover clues of a past long-forgotten:</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_i